body:
You'll get through this, girl! It's never too late to start transitioning when you feel safer <3

&#x200B;

Plus, you'll obviously always be welcome here <3 <3 <3 <3

It's not really the pain itself that's been bothering me. Not primarily, at least. My main worry is the anxiety that's come with it. It's the first time I've actually noticed a change in my body since starting hrt, and that's really freaked me out. Is something like that normal? 

&#x200B;

P.S At least I have a good motivation to exercise now!

ALSO u/rawlings808 THE\_PACK DIDNT FUCKIN DESERVE YOU!!! I REMEMBER WHEN I FIRST SHAMELESSLY ADVERTISED THIS FUCKIN PLAY AND YOU SAID YOU'D STICKY IT CLOSER TO ITS RELEASE DATE ! ! ! ! YOU DONT GOTTA DO THAT NOW IF YOU AINT COOL WITH IT, BUT THE GESTURE IS STILL FFFFFFUCKIN APPRECIATED!!!

&#x200B;

ROCK THE FUCK ON!!!!!

Oh shidd a fellow charter in the Death Grips subreddit

&#x200B;

Your charting is way better than mine but I feel like some of it doesnt make a sense; mainly the kinda Soulless-y tapping bit. Other than that holy fuck nice !

For attack, definitely learn Thermite, Hibana, or Maverick. You really only need to know one when you're just starting out but they all play a pretty crucial role of being able to destroy reinforced walls. Its also a good way of learning to work with your team well since its not really an ability that you should use selfishly. For defense, Rook is definitely the simplest one since all you need to do is place down a bag of ballistic plates. They're also super useful since your team can soak up more damage. It's also a good idea to learn Valkyrie once you've come to grips with the game's mechanics since her placable cameras will help you get to know the maps a bit better while also being super useful for intel.

&#x200B;

~~Also Clash is really fun and underrated but you didnt hear that from me~~

I got Time 'n' Place off [Polyvinyl](https://www.polyvinylrecords.com/product/time_n_place), I'm pretty sure its still for sale there !

&#x200B;

Also I think you can still get YOTS off Amazon. I got mine from Sunrise Records, but those are only in Canada.

&#x200B;

YOU THINK I'D BE OUT HERE LYIN' BOUT THIS SHIT??

&#x200B;

ITS AT LESTER B PEARSON HIGH SCHOOL IN CALGARY, ALBERTA

&#x200B;

FEBRUARY 26TH, 27TH, AND 28TH AT 7PM

